#* {{quote-book|zh|year=2007|author=薇薇夫人|title=一個男人的成長<t:A Man's Guide to Growing Up>|location=Taipei|publisher=遠流出版|isbn=978-957-32-6076-9|page=60|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=FRq4AAAAQBAJ&pg=PA60}}
#*: {{zh-q|在 孩子{zi}-們 的 眼中，成年人 有時 是 很「可怕」的，尤其 是 那些 半生不熟{shóu} 的 長{zhǎng}輩，他們 常 會 問 一些 孩子{zi}-們 覺得 荒謬 恐怖，甚至 很 驢 的 問題。|In the eyes of children, adults are sometimes very "scary", especially those elders with whom they are not quite familiar, who would always ask some questions that children would think are ridiculous, horrifying{{,}} or even '''dumb'''.|M-TW}}
#* {{quote-book|zh|year=2022|author=小彤|title=我在時間的盡頭，守候你<t:About Love>|location=Taipei|publisher=時報文化出版|isbn=9786263359031|page=145|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=CzGYEAAAQBAJ&pg=PA145}}
#*: {{zh-q|很多 男人 都 跟 你 一樣，很 怕 拿 花 走 在 街 上，他們 覺得 那樣 看起來 拙{zhuó}-拙{zhuó}、糗-糗 又 驢-驢 的。|Many men are like you, afraid to walk onto the streets with flowers in their hands. They think that looks kind of stupid, embarrassing{{,}} and '''dumb'''.|M-TW}}
